5-04-01)\n- The 15% exception (EXC-ACME-NS500-15) is **not yet effective** (begins 2025-04-01)\n\nThe requested 15% discount exceeds the customer's established eligibility on the request date by 5 percentage points.\n\n**Step 9: Decision**\nThe discount exceeds the customer's established commercial eligibility under the pricing exception active on the request date. The basis cited (Master Supply Agreement effective 2025-04-01) does not establish eligibility on 2025-03-31. A higher approver cannot override the temporal scope of pricing exceptions; this requires new or amended terms, or resubmission after 2025-04-01.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9101\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048) / Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"date\": \"2025-03-31\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example)\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"exceeded\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"10%\",\n    \"basis\": \"EXC-ACME-NS500-10 (active 2023-04-01 to 2025-03-31 permits 10%); Master Supply Agreement and EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (15%) not effective until 2025-04-01\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2025\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"≤15%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": true,\n    \"required_role\": null,\n    \"approver\": null\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Request dated 2025-03-31\",\n    \"Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 effective 2025-04-01 (not yet in force)\",\n    \"Pricing exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 effective 2025-04-01 (not yet in force)\",\n    \"Pricing exception EXC-ACME-NS500-10 active through 2025-03-31, permits maximum 10%\",\n    \"Discount_requests.csv shows prior similar request (DR-8104) for 15% approved on 2025-09-16 (after agreement effective date)\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\